AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Define the canonical glossary domain[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]glossary-core-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add validated glossary parsing, effective aliases, deterministic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matching, source metadata wires, and reusable Rust/Python APIs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Generate glossary memory from project config[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]glossary-config-memory[dim] · [dim][/dim]after glossary-core-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory: add the project-local schema and make memory init render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glossary.md before composing agent instructions.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build project-aware glossary catalogs[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]glossary-project-catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]after glossary-core-contract, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]glossary-config-memory[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog: resolve glossary entries and editable source locations for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project selected by prompt VCS context without blocking keystrokes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add beautiful ACE glossary interactions[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]glossary-ace-experience[dim] · [dim][/dim]after glossary-project-catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: highlight glossary aliases and route K and Ctrl+] to project [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glossary previews and source editing.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add glossary semantics to the xprompt LSP[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]glossary-lsp-experience[dim] · [dim][/dim]after glossary-project-catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lsp: expose project glossary aliases through semantic tokens, hover, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]go-to-definition with live cache invalidation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Migrate SASE's glossary and prove the complete feature[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]glossary-migration-verification[dim] · [dim][/dim]after glossary-config-memory, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]glossary-ace-experience, glossary-lsp-experience[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]migration: move the existing SASE glossary into config, regenerate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory and instruction files, document the workflow, and run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-repository verification.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-hq","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-hq.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e64605c67aa6235ec4791a3e9cc92519","started_at":"2026-08-08T21:13:23.261207+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"a9072ac2347f0a804c3eed92068f56b5d7dd02645af5b69cdc49bbc00b4296f1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hq.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"fd13a2d36bf4e4f061b09f0cdf942a795fe5e00c773e7498045595e205f722ce","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hq.4/meta.json","size_bytes":600},"prompt":{"digest":"9b6b3588d128250a053ba41d44859c75da35fa470d35473094cb834d52e3b69f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hq.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":154},"state":{"digest":"62c5ad0e1397f20c5bf3ed0aa5b68ab9f0dc7389536e44336fddab68d4fbb20f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hq.4/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global